{
  "$comment": "THE declaration of omx-delay, the folder's one hand-written file. Every other file of the folder is generated from it by tools/gen.mjs. Its parameters are by reference to omx-contract's delay kernel and bind by name to omx-dsp's instance face. Parameter order is append-only.",
  "stem": "omx-delay",
  "kernel": "delay",
  "kernels": [
    "delay"
  ],
  "name": "omx delay",
  "vendor": "openmixer",
  "url": "https://github.com/FreeMixer/omx-plugins",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "The OpenMixer console's stereo delay: one time, feedback through a tone filter, ping-pong and a wet/dry mix.",
  "summary": "Stereo delay up to 2 s: feedback through a tone filter that darkens each repeat, ping-pong, wet/dry mix. Zero latency, real-time safe, 44.1 to 192 kHz.",
  "clap": {
    "id": "org.openmixer.delay",
    "features": [
      "audio-effect",
      "delay",
      "stereo"
    ]
  },
  "lv2": {
    "uri": "urn:openmixer:delay",
    "class": "lv2:DelayPlugin"
  },
  "binding": "instance",
  "params": [
    {
      "symbol": "fxDelayTime",
      "name": "Time",
      "ref": "FX_DELAY_TIME_RANGE"
    },
    {
      "symbol": "fxDelayFeedback",
      "name": "Feedback",
      "ref": "FX_DELAY_FEEDBACK_RANGE"
    },
    {
      "symbol": "tone",
      "name": "Tone",
      "ref": "DELAY_TONE_RANGE"
    },
    {
      "symbol": "mix",
      "name": "Mix",
      "ref": "DELAY_MIX_RANGE"
    },
    {
      "symbol": "pingpong",
      "name": "Pingpong",
      "ref": "DELAY_PINGPONGS"
    }
  ],
  "portHints": {
    "fxDelayTime": {
      "props": [
        "lv2:integer"
      ],
      "unit": "units:ms"
    },
    "pingpong": {
      "props": [
        "lv2:toggled"
      ]
    },
    "enabled": {
      "props": [
        "lv2:toggled"
      ]
    },
    "latency": {
      "props": [
        "lv2:integer",
        "lv2:reportsLatency"
      ],
      "unit": "units:frame"
    }
  },
  "panel": {
    "family": "delay",
    "roles": {
      "time": "fxDelayTime",
      "feedback": "fxDelayFeedback",
      "tone": "tone",
      "pingpong": "pingpong",
      "mix": "mix"
    },
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "delay",
        "label": "Delay",
        "controls": [
          "fxDelayTime",
          "fxDelayFeedback",
          "tone",
          "pingpong",
          "mix"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "manual": [
    "| Parameter | Range | Default |",
    "|---|---|---|",
    "| Time | 0 to 2000 ms, whole ms | 300 ms |",
    "| Feedback | 0 to 0.99 | 0.3 |",
    "| Mix (wet) | 0 to 1 | 0.3 |",
    "| Tone (0 bright, 1 dark repeats) | 0 to 1 | 0.3 |",
    "| Ping-pong | off / on | off |",
    "",
    "Plus the host's bypass. The tone filter holds the same corner at every sample rate, so a session",
    "moved from 48 to 96 kHz sounds the same."
  ],
  "console": {
    "$comment": "As FreeMixer/openmixer integration/waves-2026-10 draws its delay stage: FxPanel's StageTimeCurve (taps) over DelayPanel.vue (pingpong and sync latches, timeMs or a synced division, then feedback, mix, tone; sync and division have no parameter here). Chip: FxSummaryValue of STAGE_KEY_FIELD.delay (timeMs). Card: useStripOverview's delay controls.",
    "placement": {
      "strips": [
        "input",
        "fxReturn",
        "aux",
        "mix",
        "matrix",
        "main",
        "fxSend",
        "mixMinus"
      ],
      "group": "walk",
      "stage": "delay",
      "after": "tremolo",
      "fxGroup": "delay"
    },
    "card": {
      "show": [
        "fxDelayTime",
        "fxDelayFeedback",
        "mix"
      ]
    },
    "chip": "{fxDelayTime}",
    "panel": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "key": "delay",
          "label": "Delay",
          "controls": [
            "pingpong",
            "fxDelayTime",
            "fxDelayFeedback",
            "mix",
            "tone"
          ],
          "graph": "delay-taps"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
